{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/4bfcbf17edc3074fa4e1947994fffd0e.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/4bfcbf17edc3074fa4e1947994fffd0e.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRABS MUST DIE!</strong> \u2014 open-world shooter with some RPG vibes and a whole lot of crabs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your favorite sci-fi post-apocalyptic action-RPG \u2014 just 100 times smaller. A compact, love-made open-world adventure by one solo dev, with zero budget and lots of passion for the genre.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/a15e757b31e033e71e90e2fb64abf6c3.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/a15e757b31e033e71e90e2fb64abf6c3.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Can Expect:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6\u20137 hours of open-world gameplay</strong> \u2014 starring crabs, raiders, meat-hungry zombies, and totally deranged robots. Your weapons? A trusty shotgun and a cold bottle of beer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/1e328c1f167471b9aab4f6b7dfd90133.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/1e328c1f167471b9aab4f6b7dfd90133.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Variety of Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone wants you dead, so shoot first. Some charge straight at you, others shoot from a distance, and some just explode right under your feet. You\u2019ll figure it out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/155dd0906f62d89f3deedb3a56236177.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/155dd0906f62d89f3deedb3a56236177.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f <strong>Some Kind of Open World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s places. Some of them aren\u2019t full of crabs. You can explore if you feel like it. Ride your half-broken bike or just walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a few quests, a bit of story, some odd radio tunes (including classical and oldies), and plenty of junk to loot and turn into ammo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/c48eb4a937117b3b6e37274b7dd42819.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/c48eb4a937117b3b6e37274b7dd42819.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Perks, Guns, Stats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, carbines \u2014 maybe even a katana, if you're feeling fancy. Unlock perks, tweak your stats, and hunt down legendary weapon crates. Go melee, try stealth (not recommended, but technically possible), or just shoot everything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get active abilities \u2014 like summoning a robot buddy who\u2019s almost helpful (on a good day).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/ca3b2d58af0002d9543229073c44748d.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/ca3b2d58af0002d9543229073c44748d.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made with the <i><strong>GLORIOUS</strong></i><strong> Unreal Engine 5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the finest game engine known to humanity \u2014 Unreal Engine 5. Thanks to Lumen lighting and some black magic, even a solo noob like me managed to make things look surprisingly decent. And yeah \u2014 it actually runs pretty well.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Random Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/63c54778f8fab2318b345cb14c2ca3de110d14a5.jpg"},{"name":"Elimination Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/32a3cb9b9237fee5fc02ed1d1982065976133e38.jpg"},{"name":"No Death Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/d5b6ff4f59b6642fbbfe93974f03df70c9ba69e1.jpg"},{"name":"Isolationist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/e5cacac0a1861472b3f1f906da2b60c882572775.jpg"},{"name":"Garbage Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/2244c9dd53d8cde7f258847921351f9a489fb47f.jpg"},{"name":"Beer Drinker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/9e257eff1a5cba43c0a77d28da13d1d855cda4c7.jpg"},{"name":"Crabs Must Die!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/65175d6c5746d2af08da4b5966d62285c2c8a135.jpg"},{"name":"Headshot Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/d2b93b7e023a7b9bcd9ce757f6a42eeb8c216f87.jpg"},{"name":"Wild Man Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/9b7615fc33ec139093389262c8ba6229ad94013c.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843400/3a3f31b9d3841683e51a013580590d5b2bbd4b65.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843400?t=1762448174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/4d66bf51c1e2ba31f20f97800153fa694d202ca1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762448174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/2e9bffff36b2171a9e89f2dd3e61864842962349/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762448174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/2e9bffff36b2171a9e89f2dd3e61864842962349/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762448174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains occasional alcohol use, lots of shooting, plenty of violence, and, well... quite a few dead crabs."},"demos":[{"appid":3983540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/4bfcbf17edc3074fa4e1947994fffd0e.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/4bfcbf17edc3074fa4e1947994fffd0e.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRABS MUST DIE!</strong> \u2014 open-world shooter with some RPG vibes and a whole lot of crabs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your favorite sci-fi post-apocalyptic action-RPG \u2014 just 100 times smaller. A compact, love-made open-world adventure by one solo dev, with zero budget and lots of passion for the genre.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/a15e757b31e033e71e90e2fb64abf6c3.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/a15e757b31e033e71e90e2fb64abf6c3.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Can Expect:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6\u20137 hours of open-world gameplay</strong> \u2014 starring crabs, raiders, meat-hungry zombies, and totally deranged robots. Your weapons? A trusty shotgun and a cold bottle of beer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/1e328c1f167471b9aab4f6b7dfd90133.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/1e328c1f167471b9aab4f6b7dfd90133.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Variety of Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone wants you dead, so shoot first. Some charge straight at you, others shoot from a distance, and some just explode right under your feet. You\u2019ll figure it out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/155dd0906f62d89f3deedb3a56236177.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/155dd0906f62d89f3deedb3a56236177.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f <strong>Some Kind of Open World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s places. Some of them aren\u2019t full of crabs. You can explore if you feel like it. Ride your half-broken bike or just walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a few quests, a bit of story, some odd radio tunes (including classical and oldies), and plenty of junk to loot and turn into ammo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/c48eb4a937117b3b6e37274b7dd42819.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/c48eb4a937117b3b6e37274b7dd42819.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Perks, Guns, Stats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, carbines \u2014 maybe even a katana, if you're feeling fancy. Unlock perks, tweak your stats, and hunt down legendary weapon crates. Go melee, try stealth (not recommended, but technically possible), or just shoot everything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get active abilities \u2014 like summoning a robot buddy who\u2019s almost helpful (on a good day).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/ca3b2d58af0002d9543229073c44748d.poster.avif?t=1762448174\" width=780 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843400/extras/ca3b2d58af0002d9543229073c44748d.webm?t=1762448174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made with the <i><strong>GLORIOUS</strong></i><strong> Unreal Engine 5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the finest game engine known to humanity \u2014 Unreal Engine 5. Thanks to Lumen lighting and some black magic, even a solo noob like me managed to make things look surprisingly decent. And yeah \u2014 it actually runs pretty well.</p>","developers":["Roman Kharlamov"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"In